<<widget "xchangeSettings">>
	<div class="solidBorderContainer settings-container">
		<div class="settingsGrid">
			<div class="settingsHeader">
				<span class="gold">Gratitude Corner</span>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem numberslider-inline">
				<<foldout false "_supportFoldout">>
					<span class="gold"><b>Feeling generous?</b></span>
					<ul>
						<li><b>[[Vrelnir: | "https://subscribestar.adult/vrelnir"]]</b> The big man himself, to whom we owe this beautiful game's existence.</li>
						<li><b>[[Frostberg: | "https://www.patreon.com/DegreesofLewdityPlus"]]</b> An incredibly dedicated developer thanks to whom we get to enjoy the expanded DoL experience that is DoLP.</li>
						<li><b>[[Akoz: | "https://ko-fi.com/akozofbliss"]]</b> Yours truly, the kitty cat that put together this little X-Change adventure.</li>
					</ul>
					<b>This project has stayed free thanks to</b> the huge passion of the people above, along with the massive help of a talented group of artists and developers behind scenes.
					<br><br>
				<</foldout>>
				Click above to discover where you can send your support. 
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="settingsGrid">
			<div class="settingsHeader">
				<span class="gold">Core Settings</span><br>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<span class="gold bold">General Settings:</span><br>
				<label><<checkbox "$xchange.faceChangesEnabled" 0 1 autocheck>> Enable face changes for pills </label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>If enabled, your PC's face style may change upon genderswapping for the first time. This setting is mostly provided for players that use graphics mods and don't want to be messing around with files more than necessary.</span></mouse><br>

				<label><<checkbox "$xchange.nonconEnabled" 0 1 autocheck>> Enable non-con pill spiking </label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Enable non-consensual pill spiking in the world. Allows NPCs to spike the player with X-Change pills without explicit consent. Note: this setting does not affect Named NPCs.</span></mouse><br>

				<label><<checkbox "$xchange.pillPermanence" 0 1 autocheck>> Enable pill permanence</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>If disabled, pill mechanics no longer result in permanence. Instead, they result in large increases in duration or pauses in the pill timer.</span></mouse><br>

				<label><<checkbox "$xchange.postPermanenceFertilityReset" 0 1 autocheck>> Reset fertility to normal rate after permanence </label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Pills that have reduced fertility rates as part of their effects go back to normal fertility rates after the first pregnancy. Note: Pills that have breeder effects remain the same even after pregnancy.</span></mouse><br>

				<label><<checkbox "$xchange.disregardGender" 0 1 autocheck>> Ignore gender checks </label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Some pilling scenes require the PC to be a specific gender. This setting removes the gender check in those instances. For scenes that check if PC and NPC genders are the same, there'll be a 25% chance of a pill being applied.</span></mouse><br>
				
				<label><<checkbox "$xchange.genitalAddictTraitsEnabled" 0 1 autocheck>> Enable cock/hole addict traits</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Prevents acquisition of cock/hole addict traits, which stop you from orgasming unless you're undergoing penetration of some kind (depending on the respective trait).</span></mouse><br>

				<label><<checkbox "$xchange.useHermBalls" 0 1 autocheck>> Purple pillers have testes</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>When you take a pill that turns you herm, this toggle determines whether you'll be given testicles or not.</span></mouse><br>
				
				<label><<checkbox "$xchangeStatSplit" false true autocheck>> Enable lewd stat split</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>If enabled, lewd stats (Promiscuity, Exhibitionism, Deviancy) are tracked independently when pilled until gender identity reaches 0.</span></mouse><br>	
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<span class="gold bold">Combat Settings:</span><br>
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.combatPillingEnabled" 0 1 autocheck>> Enable combat pilling (PREVIEW)</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>NPCs will attempt to pill you during non-consensual encounters. The system is currently barebones, and fairly untested. It could break things, so use at your own risk!</span></mouse><br>

				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled", "xchange.combatPillingEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled || !V.xchange.combatPillingEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.restrictedSexCombatPilling" 0 1 autocheck>> Restrict combat pills to same sex NPCs</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Only NPCs whose sex matches your original sex will attempt to pill you during non-consensual encounters. Meaning, if your original sex is male, only males will attempt to pill you.</span></mouse><br>

				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled", "xchange.combatPillingEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled || !V.xchange.combatPillingEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.NNPCcombatPillingEnabled" 0 1 autocheck>> Allow NNPC noncon combat pilling</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>NNPCs are allowed to pill you during encounters.</span></mouse><br>

				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled", "xchange.combatPillingEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled || !V.xchange.combatPillingEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.combatPillingIfPilled" 0 1 autocheck>> Allow combat pills if already pilled</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>NPCs are allowed to stack more effects on top of your current pill.</span></mouse><br>
				
				<label><<checkbox "$whackRandom" false true autocheck>> Whack actions can fail</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Attempts to whack away tools and pills from NPCs' hands can fail due to high arousal and low willpower.</span></mouse><br>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="settingsGrid">
			<div class="settingsHeader">
				<span class="gold">Spiking Preferences</span><br>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItemWide">
				<span class="small-description">Select the checkboxes to enable or disable each of the respective pill effects, and use the slide bar to tweak the relative frequency on which the respective effect will be featured during a spike.</span>

			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.herm" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Purple (Herm):</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Grants you a mix of the features from both of your sexes, in addition to giving you both sets of genitals.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.herm" $xchange.spikerates.herm 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.crossdresser" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Sissy / Butch:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Makes you look like the opposite sex without fully switching you. Incentivises crossdressing through harsher stress penalties.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.crossdress" $xchange.spikerates.crossdress 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.bull" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Bull:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Makes you exceptionally virile. Almost guarantees impregnation.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.bull" $xchange.spikerates.bull 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.breeder" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Breeder:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Prevents you from orgasming unless there's sperm in your vagina. Getting creampied feels really good. Lowers stress while there's sperm in vagina. Fertility almost guarantees pregnancy.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.breeder" $xchange.spikerates.breeder 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.resistance" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Resistance:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Every orgasm increases the likelihood the pill becomes permanent (or lasts a whole month if permanence is off). Mutually exclusive with Continue effect.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.resistance" $xchange.spikerates.resistance 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.continue" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Continue:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Every orgasm extends the duration of the pill. Mutually exclusive with Resistance effect.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.continue" $xchange.spikerates.continue 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.passion" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Passion:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Injects aphrodisiacs into your bloodstream randomly every hour.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.passion" $xchange.spikerates.passion 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$portalPantiesEnabled" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Portal:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Adds a special pill effect to the spiking pool. When applied, this effect allows random NPCs to fuck you at semi-random intervals, remotely, stealthily, and regardless of context. <br><br><b>BE WARNED:</b> May result in loss of virginity and/or pregnancy with no way to counter or avoid it.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.portal" $xchange.spikerates.portal 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool['dumb-bitch']" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Dumb Bitch:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Each orgasm worsens your academic performance, then your sense of malice (skulduggery) and willpower. Finally, when little of that remains, you gain sexual compulsions.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates['dumb-bitch']" $xchange.spikerates['dumb-bitch'] 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.innocence" 0 1 autocheck>> <span>Innocence:</span></label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>While under this pill, all sexual awareness is wiped from your mind.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.innocence" $xchange.spikerates.innocence 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.swell" 0 1 autocheck>> Swell</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Increases the size of your breasts and ass (Pink) or penis (Blue) for the duration.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.swell" $xchange.spikerates.swell 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.bimbo" 0 1 autocheck>> Bimbo</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Decreases your intelligence and increases your lewdness.</span></mouse>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.bimbo" $xchange.spikerates.bimbo 1 10 1>>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItem">
				<label data-target='["xchange.nonconEnabled"]' data-disabledif="!V.xchange.nonconEnabled"><<checkbox "$xchange.spikepool.cumcure" 0 1 autocheck>> CumCure</label> <mouse class="tooltip linkBlue">(?)<span>Reduces the duration of your transformation every time cum is deposited inside you.</span></mouse><br>
				<<numberslider "$xchange.spikerates.cumcure" $xchange.spikerates.cumcure 1 10 1>>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="settingsGrid">
			<div class="settingsHeader">
				<span class="gold">Pill Customisation</span><br>
			</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItemWide">
				<span class="gold bold">Genderflipped Eye Colour:</span><br>
